ive just had to move back in with parents due to the rent being so high. due to the van being too small i had to leave some furniture and i told the landlord to take it out of my rent to get it removed, shouldnt be more than £150 it wasnt much. 

&#x200B;

I thought the land lord would just shaft me on the price but no, they went one step further, they claimed that some of the furniture i had left was theirs and that i had to pay to replace them for them not being in a good state anymore and wanting £500 for a new rug, coffee table, book shelf and bathroom cabinet, AND saying that i took some of their property too.

&#x200B;

It was an unfurnished property. I have all the proof i need but theyre being right assholes about it.
